            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://sandbox.veritus.com/api/v1/customers/:customerId/drip-campaigns",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Enrolls a customer into a drip campaign. The customer is run through a compliance engine first. If compliance checks pass, the drip campaign is started immediately or scheduled for the next compliant time."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "POST /customers/{customerId}/calls",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://sandbox.veritus.com/api/v1/customers/:customerId/calls",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates an outbound voice call to a customer. The customer is run through a compliance engine first. If compliance checks pass, the call is initiated. If the checks fail, the request will return an error with the specific compliance failure reasons."
        },
